{"contract_version":"2","response_version":"3","snapshot":"373fcb69731db877929c102b75292142c0ccff1b5f6075310acc03432ddb6b8b","query":"heavy","status":"found","entry_key":null,"tag_key":null,"canonical":null,"candidates":[{"entry_key":{"kind":"character","namespace":"bangumi.character","value":"158548"},"locator":null,"descriptions":[{"title":"Gloom-shroom","original":"Gloom-shrooms release heavy fumes in an area around themselves.\r\n\r\nMust be planted on fume-shrooms\r\n\r\n\"I've always enjoyed releasing heavy fumes,\" says Gloom Shroom. \"I know a lot of people aren't cool with that. They say it's rude or that it smells bad. All I can say is, would you rather have your brain eaten by zombies?\"","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:847041","status":"source_backed"}],"matched_documents":[{"title":"Gloom-shroom","original":"Gloom-shrooms release heavy fumes in an area around themselves.\r\n\r\nMust be planted on fume-shrooms\r\n\r\n\"I've always enjoyed releasing heavy fumes,\" says Gloom Shroom. \"I know a lot of people aren't cool with that. They say it's rude or that it smells bad. All I can say is, would you rather have your brain eaten by zombies?\"","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:847041"}],"aliases":[],"identity_evidence":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:847041","status":"source_backed","type":"character","locator":null}],"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"matched_by":"fts","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:847041","citations":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:847041"}],"score":-10.012081728339588},{"entry_key":{"kind":"character","namespace":"bangumi.character","value":"2170"},"locator":null,"descriptions":[{"title":"Madison Paige","original":"Madison Paige is one of the four playable characters (the other 3 being Ethan Mars, Norman Jayden, and Scott Shelby) and one of the three main protagonists in Heavy Rain. Madison is a young journalist living alone in the city. Suffering from crippling insomnia and nightmares, she often finds herself checking into local motels for the night-- the only place she can relax and sleep in. She is also the star of The Taxidermist, the first DLC for Heavy Rain.","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:692074","status":"source_backed"}],"matched_documents":[{"title":"Madison Paige","original":"Madison Paige is one of the four playable characters (the other 3 being Ethan Mars, Norman Jayden, and Scott Shelby) and one of the three main protagonists in Heavy Rain. Madison is a young journalist living alone in the city. Suffering from crippling insomnia and nightmares, she often finds herself checking into local motels for the night-- the only place she can relax and sleep in. She is also the star of The Taxidermist, the first DLC for Heavy Rain.","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:692074"}],"aliases":[],"identity_evidence":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:692074","status":"source_backed","type":"character","locator":null}],"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"matched_by":"fts","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:692074","citations":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:692074"}],"score":-9.453762975765414},{"entry_key":{"kind":"character","namespace":"bangumi.character","value":"158638"},"locator":null,"descriptions":[{"title":"Catapult Zombie","original":"Catapult Zombie operates heavy machinery.\r\n\r\nOf all the things Catapult Zombie could launch with his catapult, basketballs seemed like the best and most obvious choice.","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:847131","status":"source_backed"}],"matched_documents":[{"title":"Catapult Zombie","original":"Catapult Zombie operates heavy machinery.\r\n\r\nOf all the things Catapult Zombie could launch with his catapult, basketballs seemed like the best and most obvious choice.","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:847131"}],"aliases":[],"identity_evidence":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:847131","status":"source_backed","type":"character","locator":null}],"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"matched_by":"fts","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:847131","citations":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:847131"}],"score":-9.296978200753857},{"entry_key":{"kind":"character","namespace":"bangumi.character","value":"2169"},"locator":null,"descriptions":[{"title":"Ethan Mars","original":"Ethan Mars is one of the three main protagonists in Heavy Rain and overall the central character of the game, and is also one of the four playable characters (the other three being Scott Shelby, Norman Jayden and Madison Paige). Up until 2009, Ethan lived an idyllic and happy life as a successful architect alongside his loving wife Grace Mars and his two sons, Jason and Shaun Mars. However, Ethan's life took the first of two tragic turns when his son Jason was killed. Heavy Rain, set two years later in 2011, focuses on Ethan during the kidnapping of his second son, Shaun Mars.","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:692073","status":"source_backed"}],"matched_documents":[{"title":"Ethan Mars","original":"Ethan Mars is one of the three main protagonists in Heavy Rain and overall the central character of the game, and is also one of the four playable characters (the other three being Scott Shelby, Norman Jayden and Madison Paige). Up until 2009, Ethan lived an idyllic and happy life as a successful architect alongside his loving wife Grace Mars and his two sons, Jason and Shaun Mars. However, Ethan's life took the first of two tragic turns when his son Jason was killed. Heavy Rain, set two years later in 2011, focuses on Ethan during the kidnapping of his second son, Shaun Mars.","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:692073"}],"aliases":[],"identity_evidence":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:692073","status":"source_backed","type":"character","locator":null}],"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"matched_by":"fts","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:692073","citations":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:692073"}],"score":-8.807517173250584},{"entry_key":{"kind":"character","namespace":"bangumi.character","value":"158549"},"locator":null,"descriptions":[{"title":"Winter Melon","original":"Winter Melons do heavy damage and slow groups of zombies.\r\n\r\nMust be planted on melon-pults\r\n\r\nWinter Melon tries to calm his nerves. He hears the zombies approach. Will he make it? Will anyone make it?","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:847042","status":"source_backed"}],"matched_documents":[{"title":"Winter Melon","original":"Winter Melons do heavy damage and slow groups of zombies.\r\n\r\nMust be planted on melon-pults\r\n\r\nWinter Melon tries to calm his nerves. He hears the zombies approach. Will he make it? Will anyone make it?","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:847042"}],"aliases":[],"identity_evidence":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:847042","status":"source_backed","type":"character","locator":null}],"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"matched_by":"fts","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:847042","citations":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:847042"}],"score":-8.74188116230534},{"entry_key":{"kind":"character","namespace":"bangumi.character","value":"158545"},"locator":null,"descriptions":[{"title":"Melon-pult","original":"Melon-pults do heavy damage to groups of zombies.\r\n\r\nThere's no false modesty with Melon-pult. \"Sun-for-damage, I deliver the biggest punch on the lawn,\" he says. \"I'm not bragging. Run the numbers. You'll see.\"","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:847038","status":"source_backed"}],"matched_documents":[{"title":"Melon-pult","original":"Melon-pults do heavy damage to groups of zombies.\r\n\r\nThere's no false modesty with Melon-pult. \"Sun-for-damage, I deliver the biggest punch on the lawn,\" he says. \"I'm not bragging. Run the numbers. You'll see.\"","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:847038"}],"aliases":[],"identity_evidence":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:847038","status":"source_backed","type":"character","locator":null}],"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"matched_by":"fts","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:847038","citations":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:847038"}],"score":-8.556113154670616},{"entry_key":{"kind":"character","namespace":"bangumi.character","value":"99052"},"locator":null,"descriptions":[{"title":"Wreck-It Ralph","original":"Ralph is a heavy-handed wrecking' riot with a heart. For 30 years --day in, day out -- he's been doing the job as \"The Bad Guy\" in the arcade game Fix-it Felix Jr. but it's getting harder and harder to like him for doing it.","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:787623","status":"source_backed"}],"matched_documents":[{"title":"Wreck-It Ralph","original":"Ralph is a heavy-handed wrecking' riot with a heart. For 30 years --day in, day out -- he's been doing the job as \"The Bad Guy\" in the arcade game Fix-it Felix Jr. but it's getting harder and harder to like him for doing it.","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:787623"}],"aliases":[],"identity_evidence":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:787623","status":"source_backed","type":"character","locator":null}],"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"matched_by":"fts","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:787623","citations":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:787623"}],"score":-8.165684967832208},{"entry_key":{"kind":"character","namespace":"bangumi.character","value":"158529"},"locator":null,"descriptions":[{"title":"Tall-nut","original":"Tall-nuts are heavy-duty wall plants that can't be vaulted over.\r\n\r\nPeople wonder if there's a rivalry between Wall-nut and Tall-nut. Tall-nut laughs a rich, baritone laugh. \"How could there be anything between us? We are brothers. If you knew what Wall-nut has done for me...\" Tall-nut's voice trails off and he smiles knowingly.","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:847022","status":"source_backed"}],"matched_documents":[{"title":"Tall-nut","original":"Tall-nuts are heavy-duty wall plants that can't be vaulted over.\r\n\r\nPeople wonder if there's a rivalry between Wall-nut and Tall-nut. Tall-nut laughs a rich, baritone laugh. \"How could there be anything between us? We are brothers. If you knew what Wall-nut has done for me...\" Tall-nut's voice trails off and he smiles knowingly.","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:847022"}],"aliases":[],"identity_evidence":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:847022","status":"source_backed","type":"character","locator":null}],"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"matched_by":"fts","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:847022","citations":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:847022"}],"score":-7.624481599034323},{"entry_key":{"kind":"character","namespace":"bangumi.character","value":"33470"},"locator":null,"descriptions":[{"title":"Appa","original":"Appa was Avatar Aang's loyal sky bison, who shared a strong bond with Aang and with Momo, as they were all some of the few remaining traces of the Air Nomad civilization.[4] Appa was most noted for his ability to fly in spite of his heavy weight, a feat achieved through airbending which made Appa the primary means of transportation utilized by Team Avatar.","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:722284","status":"source_backed"}],"matched_documents":[{"title":"Appa","original":"Appa was Avatar Aang's loyal sky bison, who shared a strong bond with Aang and with Momo, as they were all some of the few remaining traces of the Air Nomad civilization.[4] Appa was most noted for his ability to fly in spite of his heavy weight, a feat achieved through airbending which made Appa the primary means of transportation utilized by Team Avatar.","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:722284"}],"aliases":[],"identity_evidence":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:722284","status":"source_backed","type":"character","locator":null}],"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"matched_by":"fts","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:722284","citations":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:722284"}],"score":-7.55296818922356},{"entry_key":{"kind":"character","namespace":"bangumi.character","value":"2228"},"locator":null,"descriptions":[{"title":"Scott Shelby","original":"Scott Shelby is one of the four playable characters (the other 3 being Ethan Mars, Norman Jayden, and Madison Paige) and the true main antagonist of Heavy Rain. A former police lieutenant, Scott is now a private detective and retired cop. Over the course of the game, his primary goal is to find evidence about Origami Killer. Scott's partner throughout the game is Lauren Winter.","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:692119","status":"source_backed"}],"matched_documents":[{"title":"Scott Shelby","original":"Scott Shelby is one of the four playable characters (the other 3 being Ethan Mars, Norman Jayden, and Madison Paige) and the true main antagonist of Heavy Rain. A former police lieutenant, Scott is now a private detective and retired cop. Over the course of the game, his primary goal is to find evidence about Origami Killer. Scott's partner throughout the game is Lauren Winter.","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:692119"}],"aliases":[],"identity_evidence":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:692119","status":"source_backed","type":"character","locator":null}],"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"matched_by":"fts","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:692119","citations":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:692119"}],"score":-7.51771220318421},{"entry_key":{"kind":"character","namespace":"bangumi.character","value":"38815"},"locator":null,"descriptions":[{"title":"御堂豪一郎","original":"『M・H・I （Mido Heavy Industries, Ltd.）』社長。\r\nM・H・Iはジェネラル・テクニクスグループの傘下だが、彼は何か特別な目的のため、時として不可解な行動を取ることがある。\r\n普段は、娘の紗織を溺愛する良い父親である。\r\n\r\n「世の中には、知らない方が良い事も有る」","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:727605","status":"source_backed"}],"matched_documents":[{"title":"御堂豪一郎","original":"『M・H・I （Mido Heavy Industries, Ltd.）』社長。\r\nM・H・Iはジェネラル・テクニクスグループの傘下だが、彼は何か特別な目的のため、時として不可解な行動を取ることがある。\r\n普段は、娘の紗織を溺愛する良い父親である。\r\n\r\n「世の中には、知らない方が良い事も有る」","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:727605"}],"aliases":[],"identity_evidence":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:727605","status":"source_backed","type":"character","locator":null}],"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"matched_by":"fts","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:727605","citations":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:727605"}],"score":-6.846579840181562},{"entry_key":{"kind":"character","namespace":"bangumi.character","value":"2171"},"locator":null,"descriptions":[{"title":"Norman Jayden","original":"Agent Norman Jayden is one of the four playable characters (the other 3 being Ethan Mars, Scott Shelby and Madison Paige) and one of the three main protagonists in Heavy Rain. He is a dedicated and thorough member of the FBI, sent to help the police force with the investigation of the Origami Killer. Jayden uses an experimental device called the ARI (Added Reality Interface), which allows him to investigate crime scenes and analyze evidence in an efficient way. He also struggles against his addiction to a fictional drug called Triptocaine.","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:692075","status":"source_backed"}],"matched_documents":[{"title":"Norman Jayden","original":"Agent Norman Jayden is one of the four playable characters (the other 3 being Ethan Mars, Scott Shelby and Madison Paige) and one of the three main protagonists in Heavy Rain. He is a dedicated and thorough member of the FBI, sent to help the police force with the investigation of the Origami Killer. Jayden uses an experimental device called the ARI (Added Reality Interface), which allows him to investigate crime scenes and analyze evidence in an efficient way. He also struggles against his addiction to a fictional drug called Triptocaine.","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:692075"}],"aliases":[],"identity_evidence":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:692075","status":"source_backed","type":"character","locator":null}],"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"matched_by":"fts","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:692075","citations":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:692075"}],"score":-6.7321039587233},{"entry_key":{"kind":"character","namespace":"bangumi.character","value":"77311"},"locator":null,"descriptions":[{"title":"東亜重工","original":"东亚重工（日语：東亜重工，英语：TOA Heavy Industries）为弐瓶勉作品《BLAME!》《BIOMEGA》《希德尼娅的骑士》中登场的架空重工业企业/组织。 \r\n\r\n此虚拟人物条目为作品中登场的组织，区别于\r\n（1）东亚重工动画制作局：实际存在的TV动画《シドニアの騎士》的制作委员会\r\n（2）東亜重工有限責任事業組合：实际存在的LLP （条目 /person/32088）","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:765930","status":"source_backed"}],"matched_documents":[{"title":"東亜重工","original":"东亚重工（日语：東亜重工，英语：TOA Heavy Industries）为弐瓶勉作品《BLAME!》《BIOMEGA》《希德尼娅的骑士》中登场的架空重工业企业/组织。 \r\n\r\n此虚拟人物条目为作品中登场的组织，区别于\r\n（1）东亚重工动画制作局：实际存在的TV动画《シドニアの騎士》的制作委员会\r\n（2）東亜重工有限責任事業組合：实际存在的LLP （条目 /person/32088）","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:765930"}],"aliases":[],"identity_evidence":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:765930","status":"source_backed","type":"character","locator":null}],"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"matched_by":"fts","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:765930","citations":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:765930"}],"score":-6.540720688333871},{"entry_key":{"kind":"character","namespace":"bangumi.character","value":"10"},"locator":null,"descriptions":[{"title":"Heavy","original":"就像一只正在冬眠的熊，重装兵看起来是个温和的大家伙。当然他的外表也像只熊，他总是会很迷煳，昏昏欲睡、或做出温柔的动作，但请注意，尽管他举止温柔，但他轻而易举便能将你大卸八块。他尽量节省自己的体力，但他却还是很爱睡觉。重装兵不是笨蛋，他也不是你的大朋友，他通常会希望你在他得亲自动手前自己赶快闭上嘴。","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:690078","status":"source_backed"}],"matched_documents":[{"title":"Heavy","original":"就像一只正在冬眠的熊，重装兵看起来是个温和的大家伙。当然他的外表也像只熊，他总是会很迷煳，昏昏欲睡、或做出温柔的动作，但请注意，尽管他举止温柔，但他轻而易举便能将你大卸八块。他尽量节省自己的体力，但他却还是很爱睡觉。重装兵不是笨蛋，他也不是你的大朋友，他通常会希望你在他得亲自动手前自己赶快闭上嘴。","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:690078"}],"aliases":[],"identity_evidence":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:690078","status":"source_backed","type":"character","locator":null}],"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"matched_by":"fts","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:690078","citations":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:690078"}],"score":-6.004260696090512},{"entry_key":{"kind":"character","namespace":"bangumi.character","value":"177707"},"locator":null,"descriptions":[{"title":"Ritsuko Chikanari","original":"Ritsuko is a snobby rich girl from one of Japan's wealthiest families. Her father is the founder and CEO of Chikanari Heavy Industries, which is known for supplying Saikou Corp with many of the materials needed for their electronic products.\r\n\r\nIt's an \"open secret\" that she has absolutely no intention whatsoever of getting a proper education at Akademi, and is only attending the school in order to attain the prestigious title of being an Akademi graduate.\r\n\r\nShe spends her days sunbathing at the school pool instead of studying. Her \"I don't care what anyone thinks\" attitude has earned her a degree of respect from her peers, and a small number of girls are now beginning to act exactly like her, sunbathing at the pool alongside her.","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:866178","status":"source_backed"}],"matched_documents":[{"title":"Ritsuko Chikanari","original":"Ritsuko is a snobby rich girl from one of Japan's wealthiest families. Her father is the founder and CEO of Chikanari Heavy Industries, which is known for supplying Saikou Corp with many of the materials needed for their electronic products.\r\n\r\nIt's an \"open secret\" that she has absolutely no intention whatsoever of getting a proper education at Akademi, and is only attending the school in order to attain the prestigious title of being an Akademi graduate.\r\n\r\nShe spends her days sunbathing at the school pool instead of studying. Her \"I don't care what anyone thinks\" attitude has earned her a degree of respect from her peers, and a small number of girls are now beginning to act exactly like her, sunbathing at the pool alongside her.","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:866178"}],"aliases":[],"identity_evidence":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:866178","status":"source_backed","type":"character","locator":null}],"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"matched_by":"fts","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:866178","citations":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:866178"}],"score":-5.809339824016488},{"entry_key":{"kind":"character","namespace":"bangumi.character","value":"38807"},"locator":null,"descriptions":[{"title":"御堂紗織","original":"聖花女子学院2年生で、生徒会書記。\r\nリサのことを尊敬しており、実の姉のように慕っている。\r\nお嬢様育ちのせいか天真爛漫で好奇心旺盛だが、障害にぶつかると思い詰めてしまうタイプ。\r\n\r\nジェネラル・テクニクスグループ傘下の 『M・H・I （Mido Heavy Industries, Ltd.）』 の社長令嬢で、少しファザコンの気がある。\r\n教師として赴任して来た主人公に淡い恋心を抱き、リサに相談をする。\r\n\r\n「お兄ちゃんって呼んでもいいですか？」","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:727597","status":"source_backed"}],"matched_documents":[{"title":"御堂紗織","original":"聖花女子学院2年生で、生徒会書記。\r\nリサのことを尊敬しており、実の姉のように慕っている。\r\nお嬢様育ちのせいか天真爛漫で好奇心旺盛だが、障害にぶつかると思い詰めてしまうタイプ。\r\n\r\nジェネラル・テクニクスグループ傘下の 『M・H・I （Mido Heavy Industries, Ltd.）』 の社長令嬢で、少しファザコンの気がある。\r\n教師として赴任して来た主人公に淡い恋心を抱き、リサに相談をする。\r\n\r\n「お兄ちゃんって呼んでもいいですか？」","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:727597"}],"aliases":[],"identity_evidence":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:727597","status":"source_backed","type":"character","locator":null}],"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"matched_by":"fts","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:727597","citations":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:727597"}],"score":-5.328803714504378},{"entry_key":{"kind":"character","namespace":"bangumi.character","value":"166567"},"locator":null,"descriptions":[{"title":"Gears(G1)","original":"Gears is an Autobot from the Generation 1 continuity family.\r\n\r\nGears hates Earth, a lush, green planet practically as unlike his cozy, gray, metallic homeworld as possible. He grumbles and complains about being shipwrecked on it—complains and grumbles to a ridiculous extent, until he becomes a source of amusement, rather than negativity. This is usually his intent—unlike his fellow Mini Vehicle Huffer, Gears has a desire to help his fellow Autobots see good in a bad situation. Still, he does get depressed from time to time.\r\n\r\nGears is strong and tough, not so much in lifting but in endurance, and carrying heavy loads with little effort, be they energon cubes, disabled Autobots, or potatoes for the farmers' market. He is fitted with infrared vision sensors.\r\n\r\nIn robot mode, Gears can release controlled bursts of compressed air from his feet, launching himself to altitudes over 100,000 feet, and floating back down. In doing so, he must be careful not to lose air pressure before coming close enough to the ground for a safe landing.","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:855056","status":"source_backed"}],"matched_documents":[{"title":"Gears(G1)","original":"Gears is an Autobot from the Generation 1 continuity family.\r\n\r\nGears hates Earth, a lush, green planet practically as unlike his cozy, gray, metallic homeworld as possible. He grumbles and complains about being shipwrecked on it—complains and grumbles to a ridiculous extent, until he becomes a source of amusement, rather than negativity. This is usually his intent—unlike his fellow Mini Vehicle Huffer, Gears has a desire to help his fellow Autobots see good in a bad situation. Still, he does get depressed from time to time.\r\n\r\nGears is strong and tough, not so much in lifting but in endurance, and carrying heavy loads with little effort, be they energon cubes, disabled Autobots, or potatoes for the farmers' market. He is fitted with infrared vision sensors.\r\n\r\nIn robot mode, Gears can release controlled bursts of compressed air from his feet, launching himself to altitudes over 100,000 feet, and floating back down. In doing so, he must be careful not to lose air pressure before coming close enough to the ground for a safe landing.","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:855056"}],"aliases":[],"identity_evidence":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:855056","status":"source_backed","type":"character","locator":null}],"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"matched_by":"fts","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:855056","citations":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:855056"}],"score":-4.967230514303177},{"entry_key":{"kind":"character","namespace":"bangumi.character","value":"71840"},"locator":null,"descriptions":[{"title":"Cliff","original":"Cliff is a character in Death Stranding in direct opposition to Sam. He is implied to be the main antagonist of the game.\r\n\r\n\r\nStory\r\nCliff is said to be an antagonistic, rival figure to Sam.\r\n\r\nAt some point, Cliff attends to a Bridge baby, saying that he will always be with it, before singing it a lullaby. He then assures it that it will one day be able to explore all of the world, and that it may travel wherever it desires, even to the moon.\r\n\r\nAbilities\r\nCliff is capable of controlling skeletal, glowing-eyed soldiers through a series of black cables emerging from the black liquid around the world. They are shown to follow all of his orders without hesitation.\r\n\r\nNotes\r\nCliff is a heavy smoker. Hideo Kojima had not initially planned for Cliff to be a smoker, but after seeing Mads Mikkelsen smoke during a film break, decided to give Cliff the actor's habit.\r\nAccording to Kojima, when he first mentioned his interest in casting Mikkelsen in Death Stranding, Nicolas Winding Refn recommended Keanu Reeves as a potential prospect for the role.","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:760480","status":"source_backed"}],"matched_documents":[{"title":"Cliff","original":"Cliff is a character in Death Stranding in direct opposition to Sam. He is implied to be the main antagonist of the game.\r\n\r\n\r\nStory\r\nCliff is said to be an antagonistic, rival figure to Sam.\r\n\r\nAt some point, Cliff attends to a Bridge baby, saying that he will always be with it, before singing it a lullaby. He then assures it that it will one day be able to explore all of the world, and that it may travel wherever it desires, even to the moon.\r\n\r\nAbilities\r\nCliff is capable of controlling skeletal, glowing-eyed soldiers through a series of black cables emerging from the black liquid around the world. They are shown to follow all of his orders without hesitation.\r\n\r\nNotes\r\nCliff is a heavy smoker. Hideo Kojima had not initially planned for Cliff to be a smoker, but after seeing Mads Mikkelsen smoke during a film break, decided to give Cliff the actor's habit.\r\nAccording to Kojima, when he first mentioned his interest in casting Mikkelsen in Death Stranding, Nicolas Winding Refn recommended Keanu Reeves as a potential prospect for the role.","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:760480"}],"aliases":[],"identity_evidence":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:760480","status":"source_backed","type":"character","locator":null}],"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"matched_by":"fts","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:760480","citations":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:760480"}],"score":-4.847621874277844},{"entry_key":{"kind":"character","namespace":"bangumi.character","value":"132200"},"locator":null,"descriptions":[{"title":"Heavy Tank T1","original":"星尘联邦第一种重型坦克DOLLS在试制的阶段时，使用了T1的代号。\r\n由于星尘联邦学联在陆战ARMS的设计制造上缺乏经验，所以一开始经历了不少弯路。\r\n车体结构、引擎、变速机构都经过了反复的改动与适配，甚至在最开始的时候一度考虑将重量提升至70吨。\r\n但由于DOLLS在适配时产生了巨大的排斥反应，所以该方案并未通过。\r\n最终决定的机体重量为45吨左右，并搭载了口径为37mm的副炮。\r\n这一ARMS拖延许久才进行了量产。但在测试后学联方面给出的反馈则是「主武器的杀伤力不足」、「机械可靠性低」这样的抱怨。\r\n即使如此，T1也并没有放弃其作为「星尘联邦学联」第一台投入实战的重型坦克DOLLS的使命。\r\n其在缺乏良好防护的情况下，仍然努力保护身后同伴的身姿让人印象深刻。\r\n也许，这就是「责任感」吧。","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:820719","status":"source_backed"}],"matched_documents":[{"title":"Heavy Tank T1","original":"星尘联邦第一种重型坦克DOLLS在试制的阶段时，使用了T1的代号。\r\n由于星尘联邦学联在陆战ARMS的设计制造上缺乏经验，所以一开始经历了不少弯路。\r\n车体结构、引擎、变速机构都经过了反复的改动与适配，甚至在最开始的时候一度考虑将重量提升至70吨。\r\n但由于DOLLS在适配时产生了巨大的排斥反应，所以该方案并未通过。\r\n最终决定的机体重量为45吨左右，并搭载了口径为37mm的副炮。\r\n这一ARMS拖延许久才进行了量产。但在测试后学联方面给出的反馈则是「主武器的杀伤力不足」、「机械可靠性低」这样的抱怨。\r\n即使如此，T1也并没有放弃其作为「星尘联邦学联」第一台投入实战的重型坦克DOLLS的使命。\r\n其在缺乏良好防护的情况下，仍然努力保护身后同伴的身姿让人印象深刻。\r\n也许，这就是「责任感」吧。","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:820719"}],"aliases":[],"identity_evidence":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:820719","status":"source_backed","type":"character","locator":null}],"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"matched_by":"fts","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:820719","citations":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:820719"}],"score":-4.733638034382681},{"entry_key":{"kind":"character","namespace":"bangumi.character","value":"122678"},"locator":null,"descriptions":[{"title":"Nia Morgna","original":"Before her political career, Morgna worked as an attourney in Deyr, and taught law at the Deyr University of Culture. Although she came from a wealthy family, they lost their assets in the nationalisation plan of the 1930s.\r\n\r\nMorgna was a strong critic of Tarquin Soll's political programme and vocal about her opposition to the significant authority of the Supreme Court over state matters. She joined the United Sordland Party in 1949 as part of the Reformist wing of the party, and because of her political disposition and expertise in Sordish law, she was appointed as Vice Minister of Justice and Law by then-President Ewald Alphonso.\r\n\r\nDuring her tenure as Vice Minister of Justice and Law, Morgna was the de facto leader of the Ministry, working under heavy pressure from the Sollist elements in the administration. She earned a reputation as a fighter against corruption in the Ministry, despite protest by the Supreme Court. She is regarded as one of the most experienced attourneys who have worked for the Sordish government.\r\n\r\nMorgna gave her support to Anton Rayne in the most recent presidential election and was appointed Minister of Justice and Law in 1953 after he took office.","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:811222","status":"source_backed"}],"matched_documents":[{"title":"Nia Morgna","original":"Before her political career, Morgna worked as an attourney in Deyr, and taught law at the Deyr University of Culture. Although she came from a wealthy family, they lost their assets in the nationalisation plan of the 1930s.\r\n\r\nMorgna was a strong critic of Tarquin Soll's political programme and vocal about her opposition to the significant authority of the Supreme Court over state matters. She joined the United Sordland Party in 1949 as part of the Reformist wing of the party, and because of her political disposition and expertise in Sordish law, she was appointed as Vice Minister of Justice and Law by then-President Ewald Alphonso.\r\n\r\nDuring her tenure as Vice Minister of Justice and Law, Morgna was the de facto leader of the Ministry, working under heavy pressure from the Sollist elements in the administration. She earned a reputation as a fighter against corruption in the Ministry, despite protest by the Supreme Court. She is regarded as one of the most experienced attourneys who have worked for the Sordish government.\r\n\r\nMorgna gave her support to Anton Rayne in the most recent presidential election and was appointed Minister of Justice and Law in 1953 after he took office.","response_truncated":false,"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:811222"}],"aliases":[],"identity_evidence":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:811222","status":"source_backed","type":"character","locator":null}],"source_fields":{},"source_fields_evidence":[],"source_fields_truncated":[],"identity_evidence_truncated":false,"matched_by":"fts","source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:811222","citations":[{"source_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a","evidence_id":"bangumi-complete-6a75aefb769a:6a75aefb769a62f0eaa3b58ed76fb172a5dc1922a9e5be40bd7de2ff8343dcc4:line:811222"}],"score":-4.624891336052448}],"descriptions":[],"relations":[],"citations":[],"warnings":[]}
